{"video":"NEhn6jmn6O8","lines":[{"t":[0,2.1],"en":"-What's going on with Fairfield County Schools?"},{"t":[2.1,3.9],"en":"Karen, did you generate that price list?"},{"t":[3.9,5.4],"en":"-Um, shoot."},{"t":[5.4,7.1],"en":"Uh, I will. Sorry."},{"t":[7.1,9.2],"en":"-Okay, just get it done."},{"t":[9.2,10.9],"en":"Jim, will you make sure?"},{"t":[10.9,14.3],"en":"-Oh, yeah, definitely."},{"t":[14.3,16.6],"en":"Suck up!"},{"t":[16.6,17.7],"en":"-Josh, did you hear what I said?"},{"t":[17.7,20.7],"en":"-Thank you, everyone."},{"t":[24.6,27.2],"en":"-Damn it."},{"t":[27.2,29.1],"en":"-What's up?"},{"t":[29.1,31.7],"en":"-Uh, nothing. They're just out-of-hers chips."},{"t":[31.7,32.5],"en":"-Oh."},{"t":[32.5,33.9],"en":"-But don't worry about it."},{"t":[33.9,38],"en":"My snack food doesn't fall under the umbrella of your authority."},{"t":[38,41.2],"en":"-Mm, that's where you're wrong."},{"t":[41.2,43.9],"en":"I'm your project supervisor today,"},{"t":[43.9,46.9],"en":"and I have just decided that we're not doing anything"},{"t":[46.9,49.9],"en":"until you get the chips that you require."},{"t":[49.9,52.3],"en":"So I think we should go get some."},{"t":[52.3,55.6],"en":"Now, please."},{"t":[55.6,58.2],"en":"Okay, that is a no on the West Side Market."},{"t":[58.2,60.2],"en":"-Okay, great. I think that's enough."},{"t":[60.2,62.3],"en":"Can I get back to work now?"},{"t":[62.3,66],"en":"-Wow. Never pegged you for a quitter."},{"t":[66,67],"en":"-I am not a quitter."},{"t":[67,68.6],"en":"I will do this all day if you want."},{"t":[68.6,69.2],"en":"-Really? Hey."},{"t":[69.2,70.6],"en":"-Yeah, all day."},{"t":[70.6,72],"en":"-What are we doing?"},{"t":[72,72.7],"en":"What's the game?"},{"t":[72.7,73.5],"en":"-I want in."},{"t":[73.5,74.3],"en":"-Oh, there's no game."},{"t":[74.3,76.3],"en":"We're just trying to get these chips for Karen."},{"t":[76.3,79],"en":"Did you check the vending machine?"},{"t":[79,80.7],"en":"-Oh, the vending machines."},{"t":[80.7,81.9],"en":"How did we miss that?"},{"t":[81.9,83.4],"en":"-I have no idea."},{"t":[83.4,85.1],"en":"We went right for the copier,"},{"t":[85.1,86.4],"en":"and then we checked the fax machine."},{"t":[86.4,87.3],"en":"-Yeah, nothing, yeah."},{"t":[87.3,92.3],"en":"-Did you check your butt?"},{"t":[92.3,95.5],"en":"Yeah, this is Mike from the West Side Market."},{"t":[95.5,99.2],"en":"Well, we had a shipment of hers, salt and vinegar chips,"},{"t":[99.2,100.6],"en":"and we ordered that about three weeks ago,"},{"t":[100.6,102.5],"en":"and have..."},{"t":[102.5,104.4],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[104.4,105.6],"en":"You have them in the warehouse."},{"t":[105.6,107.3],"en":"Great."},{"t":[107.3,111.5],"en":"What is my store number?"},{"t":[111.5,113.8],"en":"Six."},{"t":[113.8,114.6],"en":"Wait, no."},{"t":[114.6,116.3],"en":"I'll call you back."},{"t":[116.3,117.8],"en":"Shut up."},{"t":[117.8,120.5],"en":"-I'm calling a supermarket in Montreal."},{"t":[120.5,121.8],"en":"-Nice."},{"t":[121.8,122.8],"en":"-Bonjour."},{"t":[122.8,126.3],"en":"Je cherche the chips de la marque \"Hers\"."},{"t":[126.3,127.3],"en":"Non?"},{"t":[127.3,128.3],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[128.3,129.8],"en":"Merci quand même."},{"t":[129.8,131.3],"en":"Au revoir."},{"t":[131.3,132.7],"en":"Nope."},{"t":[132.7,133.7],"en":"-You sounded good."},{"t":[133.7,134.7],"en":"-Thanks."},{"t":[138.7,140.7],"en":"Where'd you find them?"},{"t":[140.7,142.7],"en":"-Where'd I find what?"},{"t":[150.7,152.3],"en":"I called the manufacturer,"},{"t":[152.3,154.1],"en":"who referred me to the distributor,"},{"t":[154.1,156.1],"en":"who referred me to the vending machine company,"},{"t":[156.1,158.9],"en":"who told me that they sell them in the machines"},{"t":[158.9,160.1],"en":"in the building next door."},{"t":[180.7,181.5],"en":"Thank you."}]}
